mAWHQ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"War reduced Japan to zero, and Godzilla plunged it into minus. Two years have passed since then, and the country has faced agonizing struggles to achieve recovery and finally reclaim its daily life. Just as humanity managed to cling to a hard-won peace, a new threat strikes, crushing hope in an instant. There is no third time. Everything ends here.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Horror\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1400940,\"title\":\"Clayface\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9l1NuFjel2j89hiuiJbsxfblqjy.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/f1TVhqJJdxMvUsUDuKHS0ekgYkk.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Matt Hagen's meteoric rise from Gotham street kid to Hollywood leading man is tragically cut short when a local crime boss's actions leave him horribly disfigured. Abandoned by his team and with nothing left, Matt seeks out a cutting edge treatment that miraculously returns him to his former self… but also unexpectedly affects his grip on reality, spiraling him down a destructive path of all-consuming revenge.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1375646,\"title\":\"Colony\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/enz3WLx5QU1FUyhXZld04QWIc6N.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iGViga8sDCET1S6GfwOlAbuhSGQ.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Professor Se-jeong is thrust into a bloody nightmare when a rapidly mutating virus is released during a biotech conference causing authorities to seal the facility. Trapped inside with no escape, Se-jeong along with a small group of survivors must fight to stay alive while the infected undergo horrific transformations.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Action\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1083381,\"title\":\"Backrooms\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rhGx6E3qRNMgj3i5su2oukNHwIQ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/QNE9Ihuas4duMHJYGQgAcuRtXz.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A strange doorway appears in the basement of a furniture showroom.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Mystery\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":315011,\"title\":\"Shin Godzilla\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jPNShaWZMpVF0iQ7j1dvTuZLD20.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tb0uo01w2kDHiQwTszsLlSusAm4.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When a massive, gilled monster emerges from the deep and tears through the city, the government scrambles to save its citizens. A rag-tag team of volunteers cuts through a web of red tape to uncover the monster's weakness and its mysterious ties to a foreign superpower. But time is not on their side - the greatest catastrophe to ever befall the world is about to evolve right before their very eyes.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":933260,\"title\":\"The Substance\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lqoMzCcZYEFK729d6qzt349fB4o.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cL519xfEtR8NzE6UmUHyTpNO68I.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A fading celebrity decides to use a black market drug, a cell-replicating substance that temporarily creates a younger, better version of herself.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1100988,\"title\":\"28 Years Later\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/n5FygjEppOvac6yEaowi26nTyw3.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6WqqEjiycNvDLjbEClM1zCwIbDD.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Twenty-eight years after the Rage virus outbreak, a heavily-defended island survives connected to the mainland by a single causeway. When one of the group leaves the island into the dark heart of the mainland, he discovers secrets, wonders, and horrors that have mutated not only the infected but other survivors as well.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":72190,\"title\":\"World War Z\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aCnVdvExw6UWSeQfr0tUH3jr4qG.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kg2FOT2Oe5PSCgs3L4vLel6B7ck.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Life for former United Nations investigator Gerry Lane and his family seems content. Suddenly, the world is plagued by a mysterious infection turning whole human populations into rampaging mindless zombies. After barely escaping the chaos, Lane is persuaded to go on a mission to investigate this disease. What follows is a perilous trek around the world where Lane must brave horrific dangers and long odds to find answers before human civilization falls.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Horror\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":945961,\"title\":\"Alien: Romulus\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2uSWRTtCG336nuBiG8jOTEUKSy8.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iYqSQaWDttQIQzsxg9xHyg0bttG.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"While scavenging the deep ends of a derelict space station, a group of young space colonizers come face to face with the most terrifying life form in the universe.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":4970,\"title\":\"Gothika\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/frSGNQcWx1ek8dCduFYCux1ho7n.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eLBHPVQkJZyaSEUAGAFWNJJwmeo.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After a car crash, criminal psychologist Dr. Miranda Grey regains consciousness only to find that she's a patient in the same mental institution that currently employs her. She's been accused of murdering her husband Dr. Douglas Grey — but she has no memory of committing the crime. As she tries to regain her memory and convince her co-worker, Dr. Pete Graham, of her innocence, a vengeful spirit uses her as an earthly pawn, which further convinces everyone of her guilt.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":4858,\"title\":\"The Invasion\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oS5rMuJXwNZZPx0ojhvjgduglD2.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nPpIFyRRe33xKUj3nEHZZbz364x.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Washington, D.C. psychologist Carol Bennell and her colleague Dr. Ben Driscoll are the only two people on Earth who are aware of an epidemic running rampant through the city. They discover an alien virus aboard a crashed space shuttle that transforms anyone who comes into contact with it into unfeeling drones while they sleep. Carol realizes her son holds the key to stopping the spread of the plague and she races to find him before it is too late.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Mystery\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"pIeajPZim3s\",\"name\":\"Village of the Damned (1960) Original Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}